[00:00.00]Turn Of A Page - 林俊杰
[00:01.66]曲 COMPOSER：林俊杰
[00:03.06]词 LYRICS：林俊杰
[00:04.62]编曲 MUSIC ARRANGEMENT：林俊杰
[00:24.59]In the quiet of night
[00:27.46]夜深人静之际
[00:27.46]Every shadow and light
[00:30.54]每一道光影
[00:30.54]Memories overflow
[00:36.74]推动回忆满溢
[00:36.74]Where the past still lies
[00:39.76]过往不曾离开
[00:39.76]Hidden out of sight
[00:42.40]暗藏某处
[00:42.40]The stars lose their glow
[00:48.64]星星不再璀璨
[00:48.64]Every time and again we see secrets unfold
[00:51.67]总能在某时某刻目睹秘密的揭露
[00:51.67]Every strike of a bell we hear stories retold
[00:54.70]每当钟响某个故事又被重述
[00:54.70]Whispers from before
[00:55.62]过往呢喃着
[00:55.62]Echoes come and go
[00:57.52]回音环绕着
[00:57.52]Gripping my soul
[00:58.34]紧抓我灵魂
[00:58.34]I'll let them go breaking the mold
[01:01.09]我松手 突破枷锁
[01:01.09]The sky grows dimmer
[01:02.69]天空逐渐昏暗
[01:02.69]But my fire won't turn cold
[01:05.19]但我守住火焰
[01:05.19]From the chains and fears
[01:07.32]抵抗畏惧不被捆绑
[01:07.32]To dreams I uphold
[01:13.48]捍卫梦想
[01:13.48]A turn of a page
