[01:14.55]I'm leaving the cage
[01:16.04]我踏出牢笼
[01:16.04]I will step away
[01:17.57]离开这
[01:17.57]From this empty space
[01:19.33]虚无之地
[01:19.33]Every moment awake
[01:20.64]醒着的每一刻
[01:20.64]Every word I pray
[01:22.26]我祈祷着
[01:22.26]I'll be less afraid
[01:23.80]不再胆怯
[01:23.80]Of time's silent rage
[01:25.50]面对时间的肆虐
[01:25.50]With the turn of a page
[01:26.81]随着页面翻侧
[01:26.81]The ink fades away
