[01:28.34]A new dawn awaits
[01:29.86]曙光静候
[01:29.86]A new story's made
[01:32.05]全新篇章
[01:32.05]Turn of a page
[01:37.82]随着翻页展开
[01:37.82]Every turn of a page
[01:39.18]每每翻页
[01:39.18]What we can't erase
[01:40.64]举凡无法抹灭
[01:40.64]What we can't unmake
[01:42.17]但凡不可挽回
[01:42.17]We've got to embrace
[01:44.03]皆须全然接受
